OL,3,ATeenager captured after 11 shot at
OL,4,ATurkish high school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter at least 11 people were injured
OL,8,Fin a shooting outside a high school in
OL,9,FTurkey.
OL,11,FTwo people were left in critical
OL,12,Fconditions after a gunman opened fire
OL,13,Fbefore fleeing on Tuesday morning,
OL,15,FThe incident happened at the Inci Uzmez
OL,16,FVocational and Technical Anatolian High
OL,17,FSchool in Turkey's western province of
OL,18,FManisa.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
